    "problems": "The scale comparison uses only three model sizes and downstream task scores rather than held-out pretraining loss; no power-law fit or predictive extrapolation is reported. The paper itself notes limited pretraining data and some cases where MoT-st-large underperforms MoT-st-base.",
    "rows_left_out": "Few-shot and zero-shot performance tables (Tables 2, 8, 9, and 10) also report downstream scores for MoT sizes, but are omitted to keep the record focused on the fine-tuning size comparison in Table 1; they are additional conditions for the same downstream-scaling observation.",
