    "verdict_notes": "The 'scaling' variants change codebook architecture, gating and loss alongside parameter count (Appendix A.2), so they are not a clean scale sweep. The model is a GNN with a frozen text encoder, not a language model. The MoT-llama variants were trained but not reported, with the paper noting no proportional gains. The paper is a preprint and a method paper."
